@startuml
title تسلسل محادثة مساعد المبيعات - LeadScope AI
actor "دور نظام مصادق\n(account_owner/admin/manager/member)" as User
participant "AssistantPage" as UI
participant "DefaultChatTransport" as Transport
participant "POST /api/v1/assistant/chat" as AssistantAPI
participant "AssistantService" as Assistant
database "MariaDB" as DB
participant "SerpApiService" as SerpAPI
participant "LLM Runtime\n(Ollama/OpenAI)" as LLM

User -> UI : إرسال رسالة
UI -> Transport : stream message + token
Transport -> AssistantAPI : POST /assistant/chat
AssistantAPI -> Assistant : resolve_lead(optional lead_id)
Assistant -> DB : تحميل العميل إن وجد
Assistant -> DB : get_or_create_session
Assistant -> DB : حفظ رسالة المستخدم
Assistant -> Assistant : resolve_search_context
alt البحث الخارجي مطلوب ومتاح
  Assistant -> SerpAPI : web_search/news/jobs
  SerpAPI --> Assistant : مصادر ونتائج
  AssistantAPI --> UI : SSE data-search + source-url
else البحث غير مطلوب أو غير متاح
  AssistantAPI --> UI : SSE search_status
end
Assistant -> LLM : stream grounded messages
LLM --> Assistant : text deltas
AssistantAPI --> UI : SSE text-delta
Assistant -> DB : حفظ رد المساعد الكامل
AssistantAPI --> UI : SSE finish + DONE
@enduml
